 "title": "NASA's Goldstone Complex Antennas",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "📡",
 "sentences": [
  "Five antennas soak in the summer sun.",
  "They are located at the Deep Space Network's Goldstone complex in California.",
  "The new Deep Space Station 23 was added in August 2026.",
  "It is part of the Aperture Enhancement Project that began in 2009.",
  "A retired 26-meter Apollo Antenna is also at the far right.",
  "The network helps NASA track and communicate with faraway spacecraft."
